<v Brian Liles>One thing that I've heard people do is they like to try out material. No, no. I'm like Jay-Z. I don't even practice my talks. I said I practice my talks. I don't practice my talks. I never do. I get up there, and the only part that you notice that I didn't even think about is the part that I was actually reading off of my tablet because I just thought of it. I actually write my talks about a week ahead of time. I actually keep notes for months ahead of time. I write the talk about a week ahead of time.

